OL,3,GNEWSABody of man found at Hove
OL,4,Aseafront, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body has been found at Hove seafront,
OL,7,Faccording to Sussex Police.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FLansdowne Place at about 06:30 GMT on
OL,11,FTuesday following concerns for the
OL,12,Fwelfare of a man.
OL,14,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene, police added.
OL,17,FHis death is not being treated as
OL,18,Fsuspicious and a report will be
OL,19,Fprepared for the coroner, a police
OL,20,Fspokesperson says.
